    {
      "name": "Test Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Scenario 1: Complete Booking Flow",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/slots",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "slots"]
            },
            "description": "**Complete User Journey:**\n\n1. **Set Coach Availability** (POST /coaches/availability)\n   - Coach defines when they're available\n   - Example: Monday 9 AM - 5 PM\n\n2. **View Available Slots** (GET /users/slots)\n   - User queries for available 30-min slots\n   - Example: October 28, 2025\n\n3. **Book a Slot** (POST /users/bookings)\n   - User selects and books a specific time\n   - Transaction-based locking prevents double-booking\n\n4. **View My Bookings** (GET /users/bookings)\n   - User sees all their confirmed appointments\n   - Shows coach name and timing\n\n5. **Cancel if Needed** (DELETE /users/bookings/:id)\n   - User can cancel and free up the slot\n   - Slot becomes available for others\n\n**Test with seed data:**\n- Coach IDs: 1 (Coach A), 2 (Coach B)\n- User IDs: 1 (Alice), 2 (Bob)\n- Available dates: Check Coach availability"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Scenario 2: Concurrency Test",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"coach_id\": 1,\n  \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T09:30:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/bookings",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "bookings"]
            },
            "description": "**Test Concurrency (Race Condition Prevention):**\n\nTo verify the booking system prevents double-bookings:\n\n1. **Manual test:**\n   - Open this request twice in separate tabs\n   - Click Send on both simultaneously\n   - Result: One gets 201, one gets 409 (Conflict)\n\n2. **Automated test with Newman:**\n   ```bash\n   for i in {1..10}; do\n     curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/users/bookings \\\n       -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n       -d '{\"user_id\": 1, \"coach_id\": 1, \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T09:30:00Z\"}' &\n   done\n   wait\n   ```\n   Result: Only ONE booking succeeds, rest get 409\n\n3. **Tool: Apache Bench**\n   ```bash\n   echo '{\"user_id\": 1, \"coach_id\": 1, \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T10:00:00Z\"}' > request.json\n   ab -n 100 -c 10 -p request.json -T application/json http://localhost:8080/users/bookings\n   ```\n\n**Database locking mechanism:**\n- Uses PostgreSQL transactions\n- Row-level locking during booking check\n- Atomic read-then-write operation\n- See source: services/booking.go"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Scenario 3: Error Handling",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": 999,\n  \"coach_id\": 1,\n  \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T09:30:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/bookings",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "bookings"]
            },
            "description": "**Test Error Scenarios:**\n\n**Test 1: User not found**\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": 999,\n  \"coach_id\": 1,\n  \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T09:30:00Z\"\n}\n```\nExpected: 404 \"user not found\"\n\n**Test 2: Coach not found**\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"coach_id\": 999,\n  \"datetime\": \"2025-10-28T09:30:00Z\"\n}\n```\nExpected: 404 \"coach not found\"\n\n**Test 3: Invalid datetime format**\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"coach_id\": 1,\n  \"datetime\": \"invalid-date\"\n}\n```\nExpected: 400 Bad Request\n\n**Test 4: Slot outside availability**\n```json\n{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"coach_id\": 1,\n  \"datetime\": \"2025-10-27T03:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\nExpected: 400 \"slot not within coach availability\"\n\n**Test 5: Already booked**\n- Book same slot twice\nExpected: First 201, Second 409 Conflict\n\n**HTTP Status Codes:**\n- 200: Success (GET, DELETE)\n- 201: Created (POST success)\n- 400: Bad Request (validation failure)\n- 403: Forbidden (permission denied)\n- 404: Not Found (resource missing)\n- 409: Conflict (booking exists)\n- 500: Server Error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
